  m_text: "Welcome to the Archery Game simulator. To begin the round grab a bow from
    the weapon rack behind you and the timer will begin. Shoot as many targets as
    possible and achieve a new high score! At the end of the round you will be prompted
    to enter your name to save your performance.  \n\nPress A on the right controller
    to open the options menu to return to the main menu at anytime.\n\nGood Luck!"
